{"assets":[],"documents":[{"body":{"content":[{"attrs":{"id":"pb_2c4ae84745a65bf7","level":2},"content":[{"text":"导图和备注","type":"text"}],"type":"heading"},{"attrs":{"id":"pb_f646138f3036df40"},"content":[{"text":"思维导图节点表达知识结构，Tiptap 备注保存完整说明。选择节点后，用备注图标打开对应正文。节点 ID 与 contentDocId 用于 AI 精确定位。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"id":"pb_6cd432440a30762a"},"content":[{"text":"### 基础操作\n- 在节点下添加分支，逐层整理主题。\n- 保存备注后再设置公开简介。\n- 刷新后核对结构和正文是否一致。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"doc"},"docId":"pd_03c6c01065e38c0e"},{"body":{"content":[{"content":[{"text":"🔒 本篇为付费内容，购买完整课程后解锁。\n公开目录：\n读取再修改\n核对身份与版本\n介绍如何使用 MCP 精确定位节点与整篇正文，完成课程创作，并核对身份、版本和幂等结果。购买整课后查看完整操作步骤。\n正文文本字数：223","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"doc"},"docId":"pd_bdf4eb56948aa4f0"},{"body":{"content":[{"content":[{"text":"🔒 本篇为付费内容，购买完整课程后解锁。\n公开目录：\n作者操作\n学生操作\n介绍 Tiptap 整篇付费标记、独立公开简介、正文变化后的简介确认，以及学生试看和整课解锁流程。\n正文文本字数：172","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"doc"},"docId":"pd_63713eb117cde36f"},{"body":{"content":[{"attrs":{"id":"pb_daa9138b3de94385","level":2},"content":[{"text":"节点锁与备注锁相互独立","type":"text"}],"type":"heading"},{"attrs":{"id":"pb_a0a776119cf0c95f"},"content":[{"text":"本示例只锁节点标题，备注正文刻意保持公开。试看中标题只显示前两个字符，其余为星号，但本说明仍可阅读。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"id":"pb_c0cc12a0b37a5a73"},"content":[{"text":"注意：节点标记不会自动锁定其备注或子节点。批量操作时可显式选择包含备注。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"doc"},"docId":"pd_bcd11404880e3ae0"},{"body":{"content":[{"attrs":{"id":"pb_e3814cfdb44734a9","level":2},"content":[{"text":"发布与学习闭环","type":"text"}],"type":"heading"},{"attrs":{"id":"pb_2031beaa92e786ed"},"content":[{"text":"创作与保存 → 打标及简介 → 正式付费发行 → 安全试看发布 → 学生试看 → 平台购买确认 → 课程权益 → 完整课程安装 → 后续更新。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"id":"pb_efb898c584644592"},"content":[{"text":"### 发布边界\n公开仓库中的正式付费发行必须加密；试看文件不得包含被锁备注正文及其私密附件。试看发布与正式发布是两个动作。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"id":"pb_d3d71b43e5719331"},"content":[{"text":"### 使用提示\n已有公开历史无法撤回。试用缓存不是购买凭证，不能作为正式安装台账或更新基线。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"doc"},"docId":"pd_dff20429e26c5b5f"}],"maps":[{"mapId":"pm_454f63ac30c83229","nodes":[{"navOnly":false,"nodeId":"pn_a949543556f8bcf0","noteDocId":null,"order":0,"parentNodeId":null,"text":"付费公有仓库测试"},{"navOnly":false,"nodeId":"pn_d8dd25bffd5f5f68","noteDocId":null,"order":0,"parentNodeId":"pn_a949543556f8bcf0","text":"第一章 概述"},{"navOnly":false,"nodeId":"pn_437e78beed3de6d3","noteDocId":null,"order":1,"parentNodeId":"pn_a949543556f8bcf0","text":"第二章 原理"},{"navOnly":false,"nodeId":"pn_374c36f3e81666c0","noteDocId":null,"order":2,"parentNodeId":"pn_a949543556f8bcf0","text":"新节点"},{"navOnly":false,"nodeId":"pn_b23224f8ccc13775","noteDocId":null,"order":3,"parentNodeId":"pn_a949543556f8bcf0","text":"Kymind 操作说明与付费试看测试（2026-10-02）"},{"navOnly":false,"nodeId":"pn_d678c7989ec3871e","noteDocId":"pd_03c6c01065e38c0e","order":0,"parentNodeId":"pn_b23224f8ccc13775","text":"免费入门：导图与备注怎么配合"},{"navOnly":false,"nodeId":"pn_d543987dcfd530c2","noteDocId":"pd_bdf4eb56948aa4f0","order":1,"parentNodeId":"pn_b23224f8ccc13775","text":"付费***************"},{"navOnly":false,"nodeId":"pn_bd0ded70e6ccb293","noteDocId":"pd_63713eb117cde36f","order":2,"parentNodeId":"pn_b23224f8ccc13775","text":"免费标题：整篇备注付费示例"},{"navOnly":false,"nodeId":"pn_c44c3f254f917477","noteDocId":"pd_bcd11404880e3ae0","order":3,"parentNodeId":"pn_b23224f8ccc13775","text":"付费************"},{"navOnly":false,"nodeId":"pn_0248c191b681efd7","noteDocId":"pd_dff20429e26c5b5f","order":4,"parentNodeId":"pn_b23224f8ccc13775","text":"免费指南：发布、试看与整课解锁"}],"rootNodeId":"pn_a949543556f8bcf0"}],"previewReleaseId":"pv-b5531b029e1a4deca01559e8f2734cbc","schemaVersion":1}